OL,5,G2200 Emma Willis: Special Births
OL,6,     FEmma visits David and Hayley, who
OL,7,     Fspent three years trying to
OL,8,     Fconceive and eventually had twins,
OL,9,     Fand sets out to watch Fay's water
OL,10,     Fbirth - but things don't go
OL,11,     Faccording to plan.
OL,12,G2300 Emma Willis: Special Births
OL,13,     FEmma meets mother-of-four Keira
OL,14,     Fand her sister Rhea, who was also
OL,15,     Fher birthing partner. Keira was
OL,16,     Finduced, but when the midwife
OL,17,     Fchecked the baby's heart rate, she
OL,18,     Fdecided to take action.
